{
  "dom_id": "step-q100793",
  "name": "Question 2",
  "problem": "What is the common difference for the following arithmetic sequence?\n\n$$\n5,\\,10,\\,15,\\,20,\\,…\n$$",
  "worked_solution": "The common difference $d$ of an arithmetic sequence is the difference between any two consecutive terms.\n\nTherefore, the common difference for our sequence is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & ={a}_{2}-{a}_{1} \\\\  & =10-5 \\\\  & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
